bset being selected%%00010%%00010df = knio.input_tables[1].to_pandas().iloc[:,index]%%00010%%00010# writes the variable holding the subset's design%%00010knio.flow_variables['design_subset'] = &quot;,&quot;.join(design_subset)%%00010%%00010# output table %%00010knio.output_tables[0] = knio.Table.from_pandas(df)%%00010#output_table_1 = df"/>
